Third-party code and data
-------------------------
- PhotoCraft (https://github.com/storytold): the Photo tool's blend modes (app/photo/blend.js and the
  blend shader in app/photo/engine.js) are ported from it. MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- FilmCraft and craft-libs (https://github.com/storytold): code in the Video tool's WebAssembly module
  (qc-wasm, built into app/video/pkg), as Cargo dependencies. MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- BiRefNet (https://github.com/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet): the background remover's models, downloaded by
  app/models/fetch.py. MIT.
- ONNX Runtime Web (https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime): runs the models (app/vendor/ort). MIT.
- Inter and JetBrains Mono: fonts in app/shared/fonts. SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-*.txt there).

The full notices (including the MIT text for PhotoCraft and FilmCraft) are in app/NOTICE.txt, which the
site serves.
